# What this teaches / copy this pattern:
# Committed, NON-secret Vite build-time config for the DEPLOYED build (`vite build`
# runs in `production` mode, so Vite reads THIS file). Pairs with the Worker
# `env.production` var `PERSISTENCE=local` (wrangler.jsonc).
#
# `VITE_PERSISTENCE=local` selects the browser `localStorage` reservation store:
# the deployed Worker binds NO D1 and persists NOTHING server-side, so reservations
# live only in the staff browser. This MUST match the Worker `PERSISTENCE` var - a
# mismatch makes the browser call `/api/reservations` and hit the structured 501.
VITE_PERSISTENCE=local
